  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_1158.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Este mi&eacute;rcoles han vuelto a correr un toro y las vacas de la ganader&iacute;a de Miguel Parejo, de Cabanes, por las calles Vila-real y adyacentes de Onda. Un nuevo toro embolado anoche de la ganader&iacute;a del Mas de Pere da paso este jueves al desfile de disfraces.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdimecresvespradacarrervila-real14/img_1147.jpg\" alt=\"img_1147\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdimecresvespradacarrervila-real14/img_1151.jpg\" alt=\"img_1151\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdimecresvespradacarrervila-real14/img_1152.jpg\" alt=\"img_1152\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdimecresvespradacarrervila-real14/img_1153.jpg\" alt=\"img_1153\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdimecresvespradacarrervila-real14/img_1154.jpg\" alt=\"img_1154\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdimecresvespradacarrervila-real14/img_1155.jpg\" alt=\"img_1155\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdimecresvespradacarrervila-real14/img_1156.jpg\" alt=\"img_1156\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdimecresvespradacarrervila-real14/img_1157.jpg\" alt=\"img_1157\" style=\"max-width:100%;